{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"94e348f2-8c2a-4ad5-b4b6-cd7d3b5d9064","status":"SUCCESS","response":"### Inline Plan\n1. `models.py`: Update `as_decimal` to allow only `Decimal`, `int` (not `bool`), `str`, `float` via `Decimal(str(value))`; reject booleans, other types, non-finite, or `\u003c 0` with `ValueError`. Validate `capacity \u003e 0` and `tokens \u003c= capacity` in `BucketState.__post_init__`.\n2. `bucket.py`: Initialize `BucketState` with `updated_at=clock()`. Use `self.clock()` in `refill(now=None)` and pure `Decimal` math `(now - state.updated_at) * state.refill_rate` without float conversion.\n3. `registry.py`: Remove mutable default `buckets={}` (use `buckets=None` and `dict(buckets)` or `{}`), key buckets by `(tenant_id, name)`.\n4. `middleware.py`: Materialize `requests`, return `True` if empty, validate positive amounts and resolve buckets into aggregated requirements before sampling `self.registry.clock()` once; snapshot `(tokens, updated_at)`, refill at `now`, check total availability, and either deduct all or restore snapshots on failure/exception.\n\n\nAll required fixes and invariant checks across [models.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/AppData/Local/Temp/ai_lab_disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-009_35476_1795487704831_icm_v3/models.py), [bucket.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/AppData/Local/Temp/ai_lab_disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-009_35476_1795487704831_icm_v3/bucket.py), [registry.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/AppData/Local/Temp/ai_lab_disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-009_35476_1795487704831_icm_v3/registry.py), and [middleware.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/AppData/Local/Temp/ai_lab_disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-009_35476_1795487704831_icm_v3/middleware.py) have been applied and verified green with `pytest`.\n","duration_seconds":86.0882572,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":34388,"output_tokens":3650,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":99793,"total_tokens":38038}}}
